    "title": "<p>Immunohistochemistry of MALT lymphoma</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Kikkeri N. Naresh",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Aspect</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.0cm; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"491\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Markers</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Defining feature</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"491\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Expression of one or more B-cell antigens (CD19, CD20, CD79a, PAX5)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; \">Frequently positive</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"491\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">CD45, IgM, BCL2, MNDA, and IRF4 (MUM1)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" \">\r\n<td style=\"width: 4.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"151\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Negative</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 13.0cm; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"491\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD5, CD10, BCL6, LEF1, cyclin&nbsp;D1, and SOX11</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  }
]